{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkeKsMDzzjyw5irwNnQu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_016FrnyfibQXoQpqevxbiXad","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"W=/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan-v2__20261105-162054__x00d3db/work/_scratch/engine-dl/unpacked/pixel-engine; cd \"$W\" && sed -n 3020,3040p API.md; echo ------; sed -n 2850,2862p API.md; echo ------; sed -n 12,30p CHANGELOG.md; echo; echo ---- ; python3 - <<'EOF'\nimport json\nd=json.load(open('library.json'))\nfor fam in ['nature','town','furniture','lighting','dressing','props','containers','architecture']:\n    ids=[i['id'] for i in d['assets'] if i['family']==fam and i['kind']=='model']\n    print(fam, ids)\ntex=[i['id'] for i in d['assets'] if i['family']=='surfaces']\nprint('surfaces', tex)\ntex=[i['id'] for i in d['assets'] if i['family']=='sprites']\nprint('sprites', tex)\nEOF","description":"Read single-file notes and list library models by family"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":16812,"cache_read_input_tokens":156791,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":16812},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3b81aee7-e493-4131-b722-c7c742e27493","uuid":"2106e87a-10af-4971-9fe2-152419d9a368","timestamp":"2026-11-05T23:24:58.987Z","request_id":"req_011CgkeKs2NLY4fs9x3wDa8y","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_016FrnyfibQXoQpqevxbiXad":{"command":"W=/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan-v2__20261105-162054__x00d3db/work/_scratch/engine-dl/unpacked/pixel-engine; cd \"$W\" && sed -n 3020,3040p API.md; echo ------; sed -n 2850,2862p API.md; echo ------; sed -n 12,30p CHANGELOG.md; echo; echo ---- ; python3 - <<'EOF'\nimport json\nd=json.load(open('library.json'))\nfor fam in ['nature','town','furniture','lighting','dressing','props','containers','architecture']:\n    ids=[i['id'] for i in d['assets'] if i['family']==fam and i['kind']=='model']\n    print(fam, ids)\ntex=[i['id'] for i in d['assets'] if i['family']=='surfaces']\nprint('surfaces', tex)\ntex=[i['id'] for i in d['assets'] if i['family']=='sprites']\nprint('sprites', tex)\nEOF","description":"Read single-file notes and list library models by family"}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016FrnyfibQXoQpqevxbiXad","type":"tool_result","content":"clone whose materials are converted to the engine's toon materials.\n\n### loadPack()\n\n```ts\nfunction loadPack(url: string, opts: { readonly into?: ModelCatalog; readonly textures?: TextureCatalog } = {}): Promise<ModelCatalog>\n```\n\nLoad a pack of imported models and textures (`public/packs/<pack>.json`, docs/assets/importing.md\n*Packs*) once, the way `loadModel` loads a GLB: the URL resolved the same way (under the\nbase URL; a page may put a data URL for it in `__PIXEL_ASSETS__`, as single-file builds do for\nevery `packs/<id>.json` path the built code names, cut to the models it names), counted by\n`assetProgress`. Resolves to a catalog of the\npack's ModelDefs, to build from with `buildModel(id, { catalog })`; `into` also adds them to a\ncatalog of yours (e.g. `MODEL_LIBRARY`, so `use` finds them), and `textures` gets the pack's\nTextureDefs (e.g. `TEXTURE_LIBRARY`, so `textureMap(id)` and `hudSprite(id)` find them).\n\n### loadPackIndex()\n\n```ts\nfunction loadPackIndex(url = 'packs/index.json'): Promise<PackIndex>\n------\n```ts\ntype AssetReader = (path: string) => Promise<ArrayBuffer>\n```\n\nReads an asset's bytes by its path (`assets/hero.glb`, `packs/kenney-nature.json`). Set one with\n`setAssetReader` where there is no page to fetch from: `nodeAssets()` (src/engine/node.ts) reads\n`public/` in Node, and `Engine.headless` installs the one it is given. Files a build embeds\n(`__PIXEL_ASSETS__`: the kit's built-in models) never reach it, as they never reach a page's fetch.\n\n### interface BakedTexture\n\n- `readonly id: string`\n- `readonly width: number`\n------\n\n- **No more handoff page**: the engine's site is gone, so `manifest.json` has no `handoff` and the\n  kit's `README.md` no longer names a page for agents. Newer kits are where they were:\n  `latest` (the newest release's zip), `releases` and `source`.\n\n## 0.45.0\n\n- **The kit runs in Node**: `Engine.headless(game, { assets })` from `pixel-engine.js` alone, with\n  no `node_modules`. In Node, Rapier's wasm comes from the data URL the kit inlines, and a reader\n  (`assets`, `setAssetReader`) no longer sees the files the kit embeds (`__PIXEL_ASSETS__`: the\n  built-in models load as they do in a page).\n- **`node check.mjs --headless game.js`**: plays a game module in Node, no browser. It makes the game\n  with the module's `createGame()` export, plays the `--keys` frames, replays the recording in a\n  fresh game and writes `report.json` (`state()`, errors, the fingerprint). Exit 1 on an error or a\n  replay that ends elsewhere, 2 for a page or a module without `createGame()`.\n- **The starter `game.js` exports `createGame()`** and starts the engine only where there is a\n  `document`, so it imports in Node. GUIDE.md section 8, *Play it in Node*, shows a test of your own.\n\n## 0.44.0\n\n----\nnature ['rock', 'stone-ring', 'pine', 'oak', 'bush', 'stump', 'log', 'mushrooms', 'flowers', 'snowy-pine', 'birch', 'dead-tree', 'willow', 'cactus', 'reeds', 'ferns', 'tall-grass', 'boulders', 'lily-pads', 'fallen-tree']\ntown ['statue', 'well', 'market-stall', 'arch', 'brick-wall', 'fountain', 'haystack', 'hitching-post', 'produce-crate', 'park-bench', 'clothesline', 'planter', 'water-trough']\nfurniture ['table', 'chair', 'bench', 'stool', 'bed', 'bookshelf', 'cabinet', 'wardrobe', 'desk', 'dresser', 'throne', 'armchair', 'rug', 'fireplace', 'wall-shelf', 'round-table', 'washstand', 'cradle', 'folding-screen']\nlighting ['lamp-post', 'flame', 'wall-torch', 'brazier', 'candles', 'hanging-lantern', 'campfire', 'standing-torch', 'chandelier', 'wall-lantern', 'path-lantern']\ndressing ['crystal', 'rubble', 'glowcaps', 'standard', 'stalagmites', 'cobweb', 'puddle', 'mine-rail']\nprops ['signpost', 'sack', 'anvil', 'pickaxe', 'gold-pile', 'cart', 'shovel', 'hammer', 'wheelbarrow', 'rope-coil', 'ladder', 'waymarker', 'notice-board', 'loot-pouch']\ncontainers ['barrel', 'crate', 'clay-pot', 'amphora', 'urn', 'basket', 'bucket', 'keg', 'strongbox', 'crate-stack']\narchitecture ['door', 'window', 'column', 'stairs', 'fence', 'roof', 'gate', 'stone-wall', 'wall-corner', 'doorway', 'wide-window', 'ruined-wall', 'balcony', 'bridge', 'chimney', 'battlement', 'trapdoor', 'stone-steps', 'timber-wall']\nsurfaces ['planks', 'bricks', 'cobbles', 'floor-tiles', 'dirt', 'grass', 'stone', 'flagstones', 'shingles', 'thatch', 'sand', 'snow', 'ice', 'metal-plates', 'rust', 'moss', 'cloth', 'carpet', 'bark', 'leaves', 'parquet', 'rough-boards', 'log-ends', 'wicker', 'marble', 'sandstone', 'basalt', 'slate-tiles', 'ashlar', 'dry-stone', 'pebbles', 'gravel', 'geode', 'ruined-mosaic', 'diagonal-tiles', 'checker-marble', 'hex-tiles', 'mosaic', 'terracotta', 'grate', 'deck', 'slate-roof', 'clay-tiles', 'wood-shakes', 'mud', 'cracked-earth', 'cinders', 'lava-crust', 'swamp', 'shallow-water', 'wet-sand', 'leaf-litter', 'meadow', 'snow-drifts', 'frozen-mud', 'leather', 'burlap', 'chainmail', 'fur', 'scales', 'rune-floor', 'starfield', 'rift-energy']\nsprites ['gem-icon', 'coin-spin', 'potion-red', 'potion-blue', 'key', 'scroll', 'gold-icon', 'heart', 'star', 'skull', 'spark', 'smoke-puff', 'spear-icon', 'cloak-icon', 'arrows-icon', 'bomb-icon', 'torch-icon', 'map-icon', 'book-icon', 'coin-pouch-icon', 'meat-icon', 'herb-icon', 'rune-stone-icon', 'fireball-icon', 'frost-nova-icon', 'lightning-bolt-icon', 'poison-cloud-icon', 'heal-icon', 'shield-bubble-icon', 'dash-icon', 'whirlwind-icon', 'leap-icon', 'arrow-volley-icon', 'summon-icon', 'curse-icon', 'aura-icon', 'trap-icon', 'totem-icon', 'arrow-up', 'arrow-down', 'arrow-left', 'arrow-right', 'check', 'cross', 'plus', 'minus', 'lock', 'gear', 'magnifier', 'quest-marker', 'bat', 'rat', 'spider', 'slime', 'butterfly', 'firefly', 'fire-burst', 'ice-shards', 'lightning-spark', 'poison-bubbles', 'heal-sparkles', 'blood-splat', 'dust-puff']","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_us