{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EefQc36qnwPPanKj1UgbQ6","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Animal Crossing City Folk events calendar holidays Bright Nights Bug-Off Fishing Tourney Auction House HHA Dr. Shrunk emotions Nookipedia\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"List of events in City Folk\",\"url\":\"https://www.nookipedia.com/wiki/Event/City_Folk\"},{\"title\":\"nookipedia.com\",\"url\":\"https://nookipedia.com/wiki/September\"},{\"title\":\"nookipedia.com\",\"url\":\"https://nookipedia.com/wiki/Event\"},{\"title\":\"nookipedia.com\",\"url\":\"https://nookipedia.com/wiki/December\"},{\"title\":\"Schedule of Events\",\"url\":\"https://strategywiki.org/wiki/Animal_Crossing:_City_Folk/Schedule_of_Events\"},{\"title\":\"List of events in Animal Crossing\",\"url\":\"https://www.nookipedia.com/wiki/Event/Animal_Crossing\"},{\"title\":\"Animal Crossing City Folk Calendar\",\"url\":\"https://licm.mcgill.ca/Download_PDFS/G-7M2q/444126/Animal Crossing City Folk Calendar.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"List of events in New Horizons\",\"url\":\"https://nookipedia.com/wiki/Event/New_Horizons\"},{\"title\":\"animalcrossing.fandom.com\",\"url\":\"https://animalcrossing.fandom.com/wiki/File:SpringNL.jpg\"},{\"title\":\"Animal Crossing Calendar\",\"url\":\"https://live.museum.manchester.ac.uk/library/animal-crossing-calendar.html\"},{\"title\":\"Animal Crossing City Folk Calendar\",\"url\":\"https://sorry.wordstream.com/Download_PDFS/G-7M2q/444126/Animal Crossing City Folk Calendar.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Animal Crossing City Folk Calendar\",\"url\":\"https://lugbrescia.linux.it/Download_PDFS/G-7M2q/444126/Animal Crossing City Folk Calendar.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Animal Crossing Calendar\",\"url\":\"https://lbas.lboro.ac.uk/viewer/animal-crossing-calendar.html\"},{\"title\":\"Animal Crossing Calendar\",\"url\":\"https://lbas.lboro.ac.uk/calendar/animal-crossing-calendar.html\"},{\"title\":\"Guide to Holiday Events in Animal Crossing City Folk: June Through December\",\"url\":\"https://gameyum.com/animal-crossing/50715-citi-folk-guide-to-in-game-holiday-events-june-through-december\"},{\"title\":\"Animal Crossing Calendar\",\"url\":\"https://track.ctrader.com/viewer/animal-crossing-calendar.html\"},{\"title\":\"Animal Crossing City Folk Calendar\",\"url\":\"https://curvymonthly.curvyyoga.com/Download_PDFS/Tb40ci/702353/Animal Crossing City Folk Calendar.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Animal Crossing City Folk Calendar\",\"url\":\"https://dev.chyronhego.com/Download_PDFS/Tb40ci/702353/Animal Crossing City Folk Calendar.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"Animal Crossing Calendar\",\"url\":\"https://dev.museum.manchester.ac.uk/eng/animal-crossing-calendar.html\"}]\n\nThe search returned the Nookipedia event lists for City Folk, but none of the specific events you named (Bright Nights, Bug-Off, Fishing Tourney, Auction House, HHA, Dr. Shrunk, emotions) appeared in the results.\n\n- **Core event list:** The Nookipedia City Folk page is titled as a list of events in that game. City Folk restores many of the holiday events from the original Animal Crossing and adds several minor ones, plus two new major events: Bunny Day and Festivale.\n- **Dates:** Some events shift between years. Festival can fall in February or March, Bunny Day in March or April, and Autumn Moon in September or October. Nookipedia also notes that dates for some events vary between the Northern and Southern Hemispheres, though that note is from the New Horizons page.\n- **Sample entries:** Nookipedia's September page lists the Flea Market, which appears in both Wild World and City Folk on September 22. Its December page lists Toy Day on December 24 for City Folk.\n- **Other sources:** A StrategyWiki schedule and a GameYum guide to June through December holidays also came up, but the snippets I got were brief.\n\nThe results don't cover the Bug-Off, Fishing Tourney, Auction House, HHA, Dr. Shrunk, or emotion features. For those, you'd need to check the Nookipedia event page directly or a specific search for each.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3b81aee7-e493-4131-b722-c7c742e27493","uuid":"d87e355c-d45b-48c2-9c5e-3df82587f915","timestamp":"2026-11-05T23:48:09.155Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"Animal Crossing City Folk events calendar holidays Bright Nights Bug-Off Fishing Tourney Auction House HHA Dr. Shrunk emotions Nookipedia","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_017mGfroXLY3Mf1ykwoVLReE","content":[{"title":"List of events in City Folk","url":"https://www.nookipedia.com/wiki/Event/City_Folk"},{"title":"nookipedia.com","url":"https://nookipedia.com/wiki/September"},{"title":"nookipedia.com","url":"https://nookipedia.com/wiki/Event"},{"title":"nookipedia.com","url":"https://nookipedia.com/wiki/December"},{"title":"Schedule of Events","url":"https://strategywiki.org/wiki/Animal_Crossing:_City_Folk/Schedule_of_Events"},{"title":"List of events in Animal Crossing","url":"https://www.nookipedia.com/wiki/Event/Animal_Crossing"},{"title":"Animal Crossing City Folk Calendar","url":"https://licm.mcgill.ca/Download_PDFS/G-7M2q/444126/Animal Crossing City Folk Calendar.pdf"},{"title":"List of events in New Horizons","url":"https://nookipedia.com/wiki/Event/New_Horizons"},{"title":"animalcrossing.fandom.com","url":"https://animalcrossing.fandom.com/wiki/File:SpringNL.jpg"},{"title":"Animal Crossing Calendar","url":"https://live.museum.manchester.ac.uk/library/animal-crossing-calendar.html"},{"title":"Animal Crossing City Folk Calendar","url":"https://sorry.wordstream.com/Download_PDFS/G-7M2q/444126/Animal Crossing City Folk Calendar.pdf"},{"title":"Animal Crossing City Folk Calendar","url":"https://lugbrescia.linux.it/Download_PDFS/G-7M2q/444126/Animal Crossing City Folk Calendar.pdf"},{"title":"Animal Crossing Calendar","url":"https://lbas.lboro.ac.uk/viewer/animal-crossing-calendar.html"},{"title":"Animal Crossing C