, Auction House, HHA, Dr. Shrunk, or emotion features. For those, you'd need to check the Nookipedia event page directly or a specific search for each."],"durationSeconds":4.928928185999859,"searchCount":1},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01EefQc36qnwPPanKj1UgbQ6","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
